{"id": "unknown-2026-09-08-006", "date": "2026-09-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price", "supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["weak"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "South India cotton yarn prices steady as demand stays weak", "content": "South Indian cotton yarn demand stays sluggish, with Mumbai and Tiruppur prices stable as buyers limit purchases.\nHigh cotton yarn prices are shifting buying towards polyester and polyester-cotton yarns, while weak garment exports weigh on demand.\nGujarat cotton prices returned to previous levels; mills have one-to-two-month stock cover, and the new crop needs more rain in western India.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/south-india-cotton-yarn-prices-steady-as-demand-stays-weak-313315-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-08-007", "date": "2026-09-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India's Uttar Pradesh pitches textile hub plan at UP TEX 2026", "content": "Uttar Pradesh used UP TEX 2026 in Lucknow to pitch itself as a global textile and apparel hub.\nChief Minister Yogi Adityanath urged investors to build capacity across raw materials, processing, apparel, branding and exports.\nNew handloom, skilling and UPTEX Mitra initiatives, plus an AI-readiness study, were unveiled for industry sourcing teams.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-s-uttar-pradesh-pitches-textile-hub-plan-at-up-tex-2026-313313-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-08-008", "date": "2026-09-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Bangladesh curbs bonded cotton yarn imports as BGMEA, BKMEA protest", "content": "Bangladesh's National Board of Revenue has suspended duty-free bonded imports of 10-30 count cotton yarn, while allowing shipments against bank guarantees.\nExporters must secure release of guarantees after proceeds are repatriated, with certificates from BGMEA, BKMEA or BTMA.\nBGMEA and BKMEA say the move raises financing pressure and could disrupt apparel exports and buyer confidence.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/bangladesh-curbs-bonded-cotton-yarn-imports-as-bgmea-bkmea-protest-313309-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-08-009", "date": "2026-09-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price", "supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["concerns"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India’s new cotton arrives as US-China dryness supports prices", "content": "New-season cotton arrivals have begun in northern India ahead of the October 1 season, led by Haryana and Rajasthan, with around 1,400-1,450 bales reported.\nDry weather concerns in the US and China are supporting ICE cotton futures and Indian prices despite fresh supplies.\nKapas prices are at or above MSP, limiting early CCI buying and giving private ginners more room.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-s-new-cotton-arrives-as-us-china-dryness-supports-prices-313310-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-08-010", "date": "2026-09-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India’s DGFT rolls out secure API integration for export certificates", "content": "India’s DGFT has introduced an Open API facility for issuing and verifying Certificates of Origin through the Trade Connect e-Platform.\nEligible exporters can link ERP, accounting or business software with the CoO system to reduce duplicate entry, errors and processing time.\nThe facility covers preferential and non-preferential CoOs, supporting tariff-claim and customs documentation workflows.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-s-dgft-rolls-out-secure-api-integration-for-export-certificates-313302-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-08-011", "date": "2026-09-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Pakistan's +5.69% modal shock could reprice its MMF supply chain", "content": "Pakistan’s modal fibre rose 5.69 per cent to PKR 836/kg on September 1; China and India fibre and Indian MMCF yarn stayed flat.\nHigher RLNG, LPG, freight and cellulosic costs, not currency, tax or cotton substitution, are cited as the stronger driver.\nPakistani MMCF-blend spinners face margin or pass-through pressure, and EU and US buyers may see quote revisions within one to two order cycles.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/pakistan-s-5-69-modal-shock-could-reprice-its-mmf-supply-chain-313301-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-08-012", "date": "2026-09-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "SCB, UKEF discuss Bangladesh trade corridor, export diversification", "content": "Standard Chartered Bangladesh and UK Export Finance discussed strengthening the Bangladesh trade corridor and supporting export diversification at a Dhaka roundtable. \nThe talks focused on UKEF-backed financing, export credit facilities and project pipelines covering infrastructure, sustainability and industrial upgrading, with participation from businesses in various sectors.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/scb-ukef-discuss-bangladesh-trade-corridor-export-diversification-313300-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-08-013", "date": "2026-09-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bangladesh, US review trade & investment conditions", "content": "US envoy Brent T Christensen told Commerce Minister Khandakar Abdul Muktadir that US companies are keen to operate in Bangladesh.\nThe talks covered investment, bilateral trade, energy co-operation, import policy changes and transparency in large infrastructure projects.\nFor sourcing teams, the discussion points to continued focus on market access, energy supply and business-process reform.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_apparel", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/apparel-news/bangladesh-us-review-trade-investment-conditions-313298-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
